@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.audio
@title Media loading — Audio only
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Audio only
@entry audio-path-change
@summary Show only Audio-specific behavior around a shared Files path change and the shared viewer request it starts.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.list-add, functionality.media-loading.common.list-selection, functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag audio

@alias audio = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PAudioTab

[audio-path-change] Audio Files current-path event <input>
= Shared Files logic published the current path through PListPathChange.
> audio-path-result

[audio-path-result] Audio selected-path adapter <decision>
- Ignore a blank path; for a nonblank path save the current Audio plan, request the shared viewer load, and restore the Audio plan immediately after the request call returns @ audio.PAudioPathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > audio-transition
? "Blank current path" > audio-no-request

[audio-transition] Audio plan transition <process>
- Save the prior Audio plan and restore the resolved source-specific/persistent plan around the PViewerSourceOpen call @ audio.PAudioPathShow(...)
= The common viewer-loading pipeline has been started asynchronously for the requested path.
> audio-ready

[audio-ready] Audio-specific state restored <output>
= Audio-specific plan and monitor state are restored while the shared viewer load continues independently.

[audio-no-request] Audio viewer request omitted <output>
= Audio does not call the shared viewer-loading pipeline.
